  "notes": "RESO defines a decentralized standard and does not supply MLS data, so the base_url HTTP 0 result is expected for the descriptive placeholder. Current Web API Core requires OAuth 2 bearer-token or client-credentials authentication, making auth.type \"other\" incorrect. RESO specifies discretionary HTTP 429 handling but no global numeric quota. Pricing and CORS depend on individual providers and could not be established globally."
